  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have been trained to use Forgery tools, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Wisdom or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You gain proficiency in Forgery tools, or expertise if you were already proficient.</li><li>As a bonus action, you can quickly make a single page, forged document if you have the materials on hand. DC 8 + you Forgery Tool Check Modifier</li><li>You have advantage on checks to determine if a document has been forged, and creatures have disadvantage on checks to determine any document you have forged was forged.</li></ul>",
